    'gameTheory.prisonerAnalysis.nash': 'Nash Equilibrium (mutual defection (-5, -5)): Neither player can improve their outcome by unilaterally changing strategy. If player 1 defects, player 2 is also better off defecting (-5 > -10). If player 1 cooperates, player 2 is still better off defecting (0 > -1). Thus, "Defect" is the dominant strategy.',
